            "name": "Overcome Your Fears - Caretaker",
            "steam_appid": 3550490,
            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550490/extras/8a0f31085c6117ae9644d4fbe8722f2a.avif?t=1785927968\" width=800 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Overcome Your Fears</strong></i><strong> - </strong>is a psychological atmospheric horror game that immerses you in a world of the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game you are exploring the story of 19-year-old Steve Jackson, who takes a job house-sitting for friends while they are on vacation. What starts as a simple favor quickly turns into a chilling experience as unsettling events unfold in the quiet town. Little does Steve know, that these days will reveal dark secrets, and he must make choices that will change everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game primarily features a first-person narrative walking simulator with exploration and interaction mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                         <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550490/extras/6ecbcce030c3ad294f543e1e1761cee0.poster.avif?t=1785927968\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550490/extras/6ecbcce030c3ad294f543e1e1761cee0.webm?t=1785927968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550490/extras/6ecbcce030c3ad294f543e1e1761cee0.mp4?t=1785927968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environment and realistic graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological horror elements with unexpected twists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS film aesthetic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive dialogues with NPCs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player voice activity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique sound effects that create tension.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550490/extras/8a0f31085c6117ae9644d4fbe8722f2a.avif?t=1785927968\" width=800 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Overcome Your Fears</strong></i><strong> - </strong>is a psychological atmospheric horror game that immerses you in a world of the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game you are exploring the story of 19-year-old Steve Jackson, who takes a job house-sitting for friends while they are on vacation. What starts as a simple favor quickly turns into a chilling experience as unsettling events unfold in the quiet town. Little does Steve know, that these days will reveal dark secrets, and he must make choices that will change everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game primarily features a first-person narrative walking simulator with exploration and interaction mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                         <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550490/extras/6ecbcce030c3ad294f543e1e1761cee0.poster.avif?t=1785927968\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550490/extras/6ecbcce030c3ad294f543e1e1761cee0.webm?t=1785927968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550490/extras/6ecbcce030c3ad294f543e1e1761cee0.mp4?t=1785927968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environment and realistic graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological horror elements with unexpected twists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS film aesthetic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive dialogues with NPCs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player voice activity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique sound effects that create tension.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
            "short_description": "Steve Jackson, a 19-year-old guy, is looking after a friends house and encounters eerie events in a small town. Dive into the dark mystery of the events you unwittingly became a part of. Will you be able to uncover the truth?",
